(spoiler warning)

The chance of beneficial results depends on your charisma and your
intelligence.  If their sum is 17 or greater, your chance of a beneficial
result (you enjoy it more than the succubus did) is greater than your chance
of a harmful one (the succubus enjoyed it more than you did).  (Beneficial
results are exactly the reverse of the harmful ones).

Furthermore, the succubus always tries to charge you, except for the following:
If it is tame (in which case it won't attack, and you have to use #chat on
	it).
If you have no money ("It's on the house!");
If you are polymorphed into a leprechaun.
Also, the cost is one fifth of normal if it's peaceful (in which case it also
	won't attack, and you have to use #chat on it.)

When you are finished, it will teleport.  There is a small chance of it being
worn out (severe headache).  (Just "headache" means you have to wait a while).
